{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/475723-how-do-extra-mechanical-limbs-work-in-an-attack","id":475723,"title":"How do extra mechanical limbs work in an attack?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-10T06:29:13-07:00","id":475723,"title":"How do extra mechanical limbs work in an attack?","content":"For example I have bashing for normal hands plus lethal for the extra limbs... is it just brawl + base str + 3. damage is lethal? is there any way I can lash out against multiple targets considering I have (in martial arts terms) 5 built in weapons I could strike with (presuming I can kick and throw 4 punches).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T20:58:14-07:00","id":476584,"title":"","content":"Nwod had done away with multiple attacks in a round. Caused a whole slew of problems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T21:54:08-07:00","id":476630,"title":"","content":"Works exactly as it says in the book, so yes, Strength + Brawl + 3 (Strength bonus from limbs), damage is lethal. Attacking multiple targets at once has to be carefully balanced, and the closest published maneuver, I think, is the Whirlwind Strike granted from the Martial Arts Merit, which does an additional one or two points of damage per turn to everyone who gets in range with you. Whether Extra Mechanical Limbs would grant access to a maneuver like that is debatable; just because you've got lots of arms doesn't mean you have the training to use all of them with full focus (think about a kid fighting by windmilling his arms as fast as he can \u2014 swinging a lot isn't the same as hitting effectively).<br /> <br /> The Storytelling System starts to short out when you're doing more than one attack per turn. An &quot;attack&quot; is encouraged to be abstracted - three punches can easily be one attack roll, with the +3 accuracy and lethal damage representing how hard you're hitting at once. An independent attack for every limb you can swing is a bit much, but, say, improvising a maneuver that focuses on pushing everyone who gets close in with you away, perhaps while firing a gun, seems more in the ballpark of something a Storyteller should be encouraged to allow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T00:42:14-07:00","id":476745,"title":"","content":"right, especially if you consider my other thread &quot;wings as extra limbs&quot;, seems obvious that a wing could doing an imprecise flailing attack at an inbound enemy within reach, whilst the character directly attacks another (oddly I did give this character martial arts 5).<br /> <br /> Another consideration (wings aside) what if you have 4 guns and they're all pointed at one enemy, seems like they should do extra damage? maybe it's just if you hit then you add the extra damage from all 4 guns? (if each gun does 2L then that's 8L extra damage)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T01:10:37-07:00","id":476755,"title":"","content":"I would not have them do extra damage, no. In general, I would not add any combat effects not in DtD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T14:43:37-07:00","id":477329,"title":"","content":"I could see adding damage bonuses together, maybe, but possibly requiring a Fighting Merit, and definitely at a hefty dice penalty for every gun after the first. You ever try to shoot something with two guns? It's super hard to aim with <i>one</i> gun; splitting your focus is going to just ruin your accuracy, not to mention the recoil. You're gonna end up with a chance die on that trick.<br /> <br /> Combining Martial Arts with the extra limbs should be good enough, I think, to be pretty nasty in a close-up fight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T19:50:28-07:00","id":479786,"title":"","content":"I'd give a bonus on the roll or the 9/8 again quality for the ammount of bullets or by accepting a big malus(like -3 per gun) give the opportunity to add the DMG","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5064-clonea85m09","name":"Clonea85m09","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}